<div class="role-agreement-terms">
    <div>
        <h4>Changes to the work</h4>
        <p data-i18n>Agree together on any changes to the scope, price, or schedule before continuing with the revised work.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h4>Rescheduling, cancellation &amp; no-shows</h4>
        <p data-i18n>Notify the other person promptly if you will be late or cannot make the scheduled time. Confirm any new schedule in Messages. If you cannot agree on a new time, use the task’s cancellation option when available.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h4>Disputes &amp; safety</h4>
        <p data-i18n>Keep a record of your agreement and updates in Messages. Use Safety &amp; Reports to report a no-show, dispute, or safety concern for admin review.</p>
    </div>
</div>
